  "description": ".NET bindings for Affirm's iOS and Android SDKs, built and maintained by Raghav Santhapur. Targets net10.0-ios (wraps AffirmSDK.xcframework, built from Affirm's official SDK at github.com/Affirm/affirm-merchant-sdk-ios, with arm64 simulator support) and net10.0-android (wraps Affirm's official affirm-android-sdk.aar from github.com/Affirm/affirm-merchant-sdk-android). Unofficial; not affiliated with or endorsed by Affirm, Inc.",
  "id": "AffirmSDK.DotNet",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-11-03T21:53:40.203Z",
