  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 2054960,
  "published": "2026-11-03T21:45:17.863Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.0: Initial release.\n\n- Retargeted to net10.0-ios and net10.0-android.\n- iOS: wraps an AffirmSDK.xcframework built from Affirm's official open-source SDK, with an arm64 simulator slice added. AffirmClient, AffirmRequest and AffirmResponse are Objective-C protocols in the native SDK, not classes - corrected the binding's API definitions to match, removing three incorrect class-based bindings in favor of their concrete subclasses (AffirmTrackerClient, AffirmPromoClient, AffirmCheckoutClient, AffirmLogRequest, AffirmPromoRequest, AffirmCheckoutRequest, AffirmPromoResponse, AffirmCheckoutResponse, AffirmErrorResponse), each bound directly to NSObject to match the native SDK's actual header definitions.\n- Android: wraps Affirm's official affirm-android-sdk.aar.",
